# Screens

One section per program; read the section of the program that owns your ticket. Every attachment of every program is below.

## HOS — applies when your ticket belongs to HOS

### Screens

Build to the mock named on the ticket's first line (`**UI screen:** HOSPACK/HOS/<MODULE>/ui/…`); the shots under `HOSPACK/HOS/<MODULE>/ui/shots/` are the visual baseline; channels come from the registry, stubs render `Unavailable`.

